@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 微信小程序登录时序图

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E4D7B
  ActorBorderColor #2E4D7B
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E4D7B
}

actor "老人家属" as user
participant "微信小程序" as mini
participant "微信服务器" as wxSvr
participant "FamilyMemberController" as controller
participant "IFamilyMemberService" as svc
participant "WechatService" as wechatSvc
participant "TokenService" as tokenSvc
participant "FamilyMemberMapper" as mapper
participant "MySQL" as db

== 1. 用户授权登录 ==
user -> mini : 点击"微信一键登录"
mini -> mini : wx.login() 获取code
mini -> mini : wx.getPhoneNumber() 获取phoneCode
mini -> mini : 组装 nickName + code + phoneCode

== 2. 后端登录请求 ==
mini -> controller : POST /member/user/login\n{ nickName, code, phoneCode }

note right of controller
  MemberInterceptor除外路径
  不拦截此请求
end note

controller -> svc : login(UserLoginRequestDto)

== 3. 获取OpenID ==
svc -> wechatSvc : getOpenid(code)
wechatSvc -> wxSvr : HTTP GET\nhttps://api.weixin.qq.com/...\n?appid=xxx&secret=xxx&js_code=xxx
wxSvr --> wechatSvc : { openid, session_key }
wechatSvc --> svc : openId字符串

== 4. 查询/创建用户 ==
svc -> mapper : selectOne openId=?
mapper -> db : SELECT * FROM family_member\nWHERE open_id = ?
db --> mapper : FamilyMember (或null)
mapper --> svc : 结果

alt 用户不存在
  svc -> svc : 创建新的FamilyMember\n设置openId
end

== 5. 获取手机号 ==
svc -> wechatSvc : getPhone(phoneCode)
wechatSvc -> wxSvr : HTTP POST\n获取手机号接口
wxSvr --> wechatSvc : { phoneNumber }
wechatSvc --> svc : phone字符串

== 6. 保存/更新用户 ==
alt 已存在用户且手机号变化
  svc -> mapper : updateById(新手机号)
else 新用户
  svc -> svc : 随机生成昵称\n(吉祥词+手机号后4位)
  svc -> mapper : insert(新用户)
end

== 7. 生成JWT Token ==
svc -> tokenSvc : createToken({userId, nickName})
tokenSvc -> tokenSvc : 使用HS512签名
tokenSvc --> svc : JWT token字符串
svc --> controller : LoginVo{token, nickName}
controller --> mini : 返回登录结果

== 8. 后续请求鉴权 ==
note over mini, tokenSvc
  后续 /member/** 请求
  MemberInterceptor 拦截并解析JWT
  提取userId存入UserThreadLocal
end note

mini -> mini : 存储token\n跳转首页
user <- mini : 登录成功

@enduml
